/**
 * PHASE 187 — og:image coverage law (deep-audit P0-2).
 * Live audit: the biggest indexable surfaces shared NO social card —
 * exercises (SSG), foods, muscle hubs, collections, tools, blog
 * categories and the AR root (the AR layout declared its own
 * openGraph without images, so every AR page without its own block
 * inherited nothing). Fix: 14 static branded family cards
 * (public/images/og/ — design mirrors /api/og-image, generated by
 * scripts/generate-og-cards.py with the self-hosted Cairo fonts).
 *
 * §12.53 item 4 (2026-09-15, second deep audit): the EN LIST surfaces
 * still shared no card — their layouts/pages declare their own
 * openGraph, which REPLACES the root block in Next.js metadata merging,
 * so nothing was inherited (the AR mirrors inherit og-home-ar from
 * /ar/layout.tsx; the EN side inherited nothing). The same surfaces are
 * now wired: /exercises · /foods · /programs · /coaching · /memberships
 * · /evo · /diet-plan hub + cells · /equipment/* (family cards where a
 * matching one exists — exercises/foods — the home card elsewhere,
 * mirroring the AR inheritance behavior exactly).
 *
 * Batch 1-b (2026-09-16): the SAME replace-not-inherit gap existed on
 * three AR mirrors the batch-1 live verification caught — /ar/evo,
 * /ar/coaching and /ar/diet-plan (hub + 24 cells) declared openGraph
 * without images, so og-home-ar was NOT inherited. All four surfaces are
 * now wired with the home card — exact mirror of the EN fix.
 *
 * Discovery 208 → Phase 209 (2026-09-16, owner order): the EN side of the
 * affiliate pair had the identical gap all along — /affiliate's own
 * openGraph block served no card at all (it wasn't on the item-4 audit
 * list of EN surfaces). og-home-en pinned; both halves of the pair are
 * now guarded.
 *
 * Phase 218 (D-02 — owner deferred-item reopened 2026-09-17): the coach
 * landing pair (EN canonical + AR mirror). noindex pages, but coaches
 * share the URLs DIRECTLY (WhatsApp/X embeds) and the child openGraph
 * block replaces the root card — every share rendered cardless. Home
 * card pinned on both halves.
 *
 * Guarded contracts:
 *   1. Every wired surface references its family og asset in BOTH
 *      openGraph.images and twitter.images.
 *   2. Wired twitter cards are summary_large_image (a "summary" card
 *      ignores images — pointless with a 1200×630 asset).
 *   3. All 14 assets exist on disk.
 *   4. No wired surface regresses to /logo.png.
 */

